WEBVTT

00:00:02.540 --> 00:00:03.780
What's happening?

00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:16.580
Wha—

00:00:25.210 --> 00:00:26.790
Yukine...

00:00:27.780 --> 00:00:29.210
Goodbye.

00:02:13.250 --> 00:02:16.400
Sorry, but I'm keeping this.

00:02:17.500 --> 00:02:20.160
Please... Stop everyone.

00:02:22.080 --> 00:02:23.230
Save them.

00:02:24.330 --> 00:02:28.830
<b>Episode 11 
Destiny Ark</b>

00:02:24.430 --> 00:02:25.670
Displaying image.

00:02:27.490 --> 00:02:28.660
This is

00:02:28.960 --> 00:02:31.580
the Frontier that FIS was after?

00:02:32.870 --> 00:02:36.090
The part above the surface is only 
a small portion of the whole.

00:02:36.630 --> 00:02:39.360
I can understand why they call it "Frontier."

00:02:39.990 --> 00:02:42.850
Another US fleet is approaching.

00:02:43.630 --> 00:02:44.970
A second wave, huh?

00:02:46.560 --> 00:02:50.450
Uncle Sam isn't planning on moving to Frontier

00:02:50.450 --> 00:02:53.520
to avoid the lunar impact?

00:02:54.970 --> 00:02:56.860
We'll head there immediately, as well.

00:03:01.110 --> 00:03:02.530
Miku!

00:03:05.600 --> 00:03:07.040
How is Kohinata's condition?

00:03:07.360 --> 00:03:09.410
The LiNKER's been flushed from her system,

00:03:09.410 --> 00:03:12.170
and there are no visible aftereffects of Gear use.

00:03:12.550 --> 00:03:13.820
I'm glad!

00:03:14.120 --> 00:03:16.170
I'm so glad!

00:03:18.530 --> 00:03:21.050
Hibiki, those wounds...

00:03:24.240 --> 00:03:24.970
Yeah.

00:03:25.610 --> 00:03:26.830
They're my...

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:29.490
They're my fault, aren't they?

00:03:30.190 --> 00:03:32.190
Yeah, it's thanks to you!

00:03:33.990 --> 00:03:35.880
Thank you, Miku.

00:03:36.210 --> 00:03:37.330
Hibiki?

00:03:37.670 --> 00:03:39.850
I didn't save you.

00:03:40.150 --> 00:03:42.860
You saved me!

00:03:44.060 --> 00:03:46.120
This is your body?

00:03:46.480 --> 00:03:48.530
That Gear's light has the power

00:03:48.530 --> 00:03:52.960
to degrade and neutralize any relic-derived power.

00:03:53.730 --> 00:03:56.480
The result was that, not only were 
both of your Gears removed,

00:03:56.480 --> 00:04:00.490
but the Gungnir fragments in her 
body were removed, as well.

00:04:02.750 --> 00:04:04.960
Your strong feelings for her

00:04:04.960 --> 00:04:08.570
saved Tachibana, as she rushed to her death.

00:04:08.890 --> 00:04:11.110
When I was really in trouble,

00:04:11.110 --> 00:04:13.410
you did come to save me!

00:04:13.740 --> 00:04:14.940
Thank you!

00:04:15.760 --> 00:04:18.730
I saved you?

00:04:18.730 --> 00:04:19.640
Yeah.

00:04:21.430 --> 00:04:23.630
<i>But then...</i>

00:04:26.570 --> 00:04:30.430
But FIS has finally caused Frontier to surface.

00:04:30.820 --> 00:04:32.580
The real battle is just beginning.

00:04:33.110 --> 00:04:36.870
I can deal with the plans of FIS myself.

00:04:36.870 --> 00:04:38.250
No need to worry.

00:04:38.550 --> 00:04:39.640
Alone?

00:04:39.940 --> 00:04:42.170
Come to think of it, where's Chris?

00:04:49.150 --> 00:04:52.150
I can't believe something like this 
was sleeping beneath the sea.

00:04:52.150 --> 00:04:54.690
This is the new world you wanted.

00:04:58.290 --> 00:05:01.900
You're betraying your friends to join us?

00:05:01.900 --> 00:05:04.150
This is my proof.

00:05:05.420 --> 00:05:06.700
But...

00:05:07.060 --> 00:05:09.200
The only thing which can destroy power

00:05:09.200 --> 00:05:11.300
is an even greater power.

00:05:11.800 --> 00:05:15.330
My wish is for battles to cease their spread.

00:05:15.630 --> 00:05:18.210
I want as few as possible to die needlessly.

00:05:26.700 --> 00:05:29.550
And you truly believe that fighting with us

00:05:29.550 --> 00:05:32.260
will stop battle from spreading?

00:05:33.140 --> 00:05:34.980
You don't trust me...

00:05:35.420 --> 00:05:39.300
When I'm on the front lines, you can 
shoot me from behind

00:05:39.300 --> 00:05:40.690
if you don't like it.

00:05:41.040 --> 00:05:43.830
Of course. That's the plan.

00:05:45.670 --> 00:05:47.030
We're here.

00:05:47.030 --> 00:05:49.320
This is the generator room.

00:05:52.650 --> 00:05:54.370
What is that?

00:06:20.160 --> 00:06:21.980
The heart of the Nephilim...

00:06:22.580 --> 00:06:24.660
Even reduced to a heart,

00:06:24.660 --> 00:06:28.660
its ability to devour and assimilate relics remains.

00:06:28.660 --> 00:06:30.530
It's such a glutton...

00:06:37.150 --> 00:06:40.790
Apparently, the energy has traveled 
throughout all of Frontier.

00:06:41.010 --> 00:06:44.800
Okay, I'll head to the bridge.

00:06:45.100 --> 00:06:46.840
I'd like Dr. Nastassja

00:06:46.840 --> 00:06:50.650
to take care of Frontier from the control room.

00:06:56.320 --> 00:07:00.020
The doctor's method of doing 
things won't save the weak.

00:07:00.930 --> 00:07:02.450
That isn't true...

00:07:02.930 --> 00:07:06.650
Without Frontier's power, we can't save anyone.

00:07:07.180 --> 00:07:09.710
I can't even save you!

00:07:11.330 --> 00:07:14.530
She said that she wants us to save them?

00:07:14.530 --> 00:07:18.330
Yes, her friends have lost sight of their 
goal and are out of control.

00:07:18.330 --> 00:07:19.870
And she wants us to stop them.

00:07:24.320 --> 00:07:26.500
You need to stay in bed!

00:07:26.950 --> 00:07:28.120
I'm sorry.

00:07:28.420 --> 00:07:31.310
But I just couldn't keep lying down.

00:07:31.310 --> 00:07:35.140
When she heard Chris-chan left, she insisted.

00:07:35.410 --> 00:07:38.660
It's true that Hibiki-kun and Chris-kun's loss

00:07:38.660 --> 00:07:42.020
poses a problem for the mission, but...

00:07:42.340 --> 00:07:46.180
I'm really glad Tsubasa-san wasn't badly hurt.

00:07:46.480 --> 00:07:49.650
Dodging all the vital shots is just like you.

00:07:50.270 --> 00:07:51.380
<i>Dodging?</i>

00:07:51.860 --> 00:07:54.830
<i>Back there, was I really capable 
of dodging Yukine's shots?</i>

00:07:55.460 --> 00:07:57.800
<i>Which means that was...</i>

00:07:58.630 --> 00:08:01.040
We're arriving at Frontier!

00:08:15.950 --> 00:08:17.020
What is that?

00:08:17.020 --> 00:08:18.750
LiNKER.

00:08:20.070 --> 00:08:22.040
A LiNKER made from

00:08:22.040 --> 00:08:25.690
the Nephilim's relic-absorbing cells...

00:08:41.100 --> 00:08:43.060
I can't wait to turn it on.

00:08:43.360 --> 00:08:46.560
Do you think I could, just a little?

00:08:46.560 --> 00:08:48.090
Well, Maria?

00:08:57.370 --> 00:08:59.930
<i>If Frontier belonged to the Custodians,</i>

00:08:59.930 --> 00:09:02.280
<i>who arrived during prehistoric eras,</i>

00:09:02.280 --> 00:09:04.820
<i>it should be filled with heretical technology.</i>

00:09:05.290 --> 00:09:08.310
<i>There must be some way to deal 
with the Moon's falling.</i>

00:09:09.430 --> 00:09:10.320
<i>What is this?</i>

00:09:10.620 --> 00:09:14.100
We seem to have a situation.

00:09:15.130 --> 00:09:17.330
By connecting to it,

00:09:17.330 --> 00:09:20.700
I can sense Frontier's energy state...

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:24.550
This is more than enough to make it lose its temper.

00:09:24.550 --> 00:09:26.460
It's too soon, Doctor!

00:09:26.750 --> 00:09:28.830
Now, go!

00:09:51.400 --> 00:09:54.490
Here we go!

00:10:04.820 --> 00:10:07.040
The doctor's greed is only accelerating.

00:10:07.580 --> 00:10:09.310
I must stop him with

00:10:09.310 --> 00:10:12.460
the heretical technology I trusted, 
before it's too late.

00:10:16.020 --> 00:10:17.550
What's going on?

00:10:17.840 --> 00:10:20.190
Over a wide area, the sea floor is coming up!

00:10:20.490 --> 00:10:22.620
It's rising directly below us, as well!

00:10:35.220 --> 00:10:37.030
Message from Strategic Command!

00:10:37.030 --> 00:10:38.570
They want us to take control of it.

00:10:38.870 --> 00:10:40.750
No one said anything about it being that big!

00:10:48.210 --> 00:10:52.210
It's so fun, it feels like my glasses 
are about to slide off my face!

00:11:12.700 --> 00:11:14.770
This seems to be the limit of

00:11:14.770 --> 00:11:17.030
the gravity that I can control.

00:11:20.770 --> 00:11:22.390
<i>Is this really the power</i>

00:11:22.390 --> 00:11:25.120
<i>that will save humanity?</i>

00:11:25.560 --> 00:11:28.790
Now that I have the power to trample...

00:11:29.370 --> 00:11:32.170
Now I can be a hero!

00:11:32.540 --> 00:11:35.720
The last action hero of this world!

00:11:37.670 --> 00:11:38.980
Hooray!

00:11:41.960 --> 00:11:42.800
<i>Take a look.</i>

00:11:43.110 --> 00:11:46.520
<i>Military action in the sea, where large-scale 
tectonic plate activity was reported.</i>

00:11:46.520 --> 00:11:48.580
<i>A US fleet was wiped out in an instant—</i>

00:11:51.060 --> 00:11:56.190
<b>This Is a Test of the Emergency Broadcast System</b>

00:11:53.770 --> 00:11:56.190
Teraji, isn't this stuff...

00:11:56.830 --> 00:11:58.650
Don't tell me Tachibana-san...

00:11:58.950 --> 00:12:00.570
...is caught up in this, too.

00:12:03.860 --> 00:12:06.080
Looks like we took a good hit from below.

00:12:06.480 --> 00:12:08.010
Analysis results are in.

00:12:08.240 --> 00:12:10.150
The rising crust from directly beneath us

00:12:10.150 --> 00:12:12.500
resulted from their shooting 
an anchor into the Moon.

00:12:12.500 --> 00:12:14.540
To raise Frontier?

00:12:14.540 --> 00:12:16.420
Yes, and not only that...

00:12:16.930 --> 00:12:20.590
The fare for that little trip was 
bringing the Moon closer.

00:12:20.590 --> 00:12:21.790
The Moon?

00:12:21.790 --> 00:12:23.400
You brought the impact closer?

00:12:24.470 --> 00:12:26.700
We haven't made any preparations to save anyone.

00:12:26.700 --> 00:12:30.150
This really will wipe out humanity!

00:12:30.800 --> 00:12:31.770
Why?

00:12:32.150 --> 00:12:34.480
Why won't it accept my commands?

00:12:35.980 --> 00:12:38.040
As long as the LiNKER is functional,

00:12:38.040 --> 00:12:40.030
I have control rights.

00:12:40.460 --> 00:12:43.050
Humanity won't go extinct,

00:12:43.050 --> 00:12:45.280
as long as I'm alive.

00:12:45.690 --> 00:12:47.450
This is my proposal,

00:12:47.450 --> 00:12:50.790
the most certain way to save humanity.

00:12:50.790 --> 00:12:52.520
I didn't commit

00:12:52.520 --> 00:12:54.840
all of those evil deeds for this—

00:12:57.620 --> 00:12:59.630
You can kill me here,

00:12:59.630 --> 00:13:03.250
but that won't change the fact that 
Earth's about to be doomed.

00:13:03.250 --> 00:13:04.970
You're such a stupid girl!

00:13:05.300 --> 00:13:07.850
Just lie there in embarrassment,

00:13:08.390 --> 00:13:11.130
remembering how you pretended to be Finé.

00:13:11.700 --> 00:13:15.090
Serena... Serena, I...

00:13:16.100 --> 00:13:18.260
Cry as long as you like.

00:13:19.360 --> 00:13:20.690
When I get back,

00:13:20.690 --> 00:13:24.100
let's think about how we're going to rebuild

00:13:24.100 --> 00:13:25.850
the small population of survivors.

00:13:30.290 --> 00:13:31.670
Tsubasa, are you ready?

00:13:31.670 --> 00:13:32.670
Of course.

00:13:33.480 --> 00:13:34.460
Tsubasa-san...

00:13:35.870 --> 00:13:36.960
Don't worry.

00:13:37.460 --> 00:13:39.920
I'm used to standing on the stage alone.

00:13:49.790 --> 00:13:57.230
<i>Imyuteus Ame no Habakiri tron.</i>

00:14:17.830 --> 00:14:23.970
<i>First blade. As fast as wind 
racing from a thunderbolt.</i>

00:14:21.920 --> 00:14:23.500
<b>Cavalry Flash</b>

00:14:23.820 --> 00:14:25.010
Tsubasa-san is amazing!

00:14:23.970 --> 00:14:30.860
<i>Second blade. A state of emptiness, 
like a still forest...</i>

00:14:25.240 --> 00:14:27.100
We only have one wielder.

00:14:27.400 --> 00:14:29.130
What do we do now?

00:14:29.460 --> 00:14:32.140
No, we have another.

00:14:32.500 --> 00:14:35.890
I'm not letting you fight without a Gear.

00:14:36.130 --> 00:14:38.450
I wouldn't be the one fighting.

00:14:38.450 --> 00:14:39.540
Hibiki...

00:14:44.070 --> 00:14:46.290
You're ordering a prisoner to attack?

00:14:46.290 --> 00:14:48.030
How serious are you?

00:14:48.030 --> 00:14:49.470
Totally, of course.

00:14:50.300 --> 00:14:52.760
I don't like that about you.

00:14:53.060 --> 00:14:56.450
You're a hypocrite, who waves 
her righteousness around.

00:14:56.710 --> 00:14:59.000
I don't think

00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:01.170
what I'm doing is necessarily right...

00:15:01.910 --> 00:15:04.460
Once, when I got very badly hurt,

00:15:04.460 --> 00:15:08.670
I spent a lot of time in physical therapy, 
hoping my family would be happy.

00:15:09.120 --> 00:15:11.140
But even after I got home,

00:15:11.140 --> 00:15:14.360
my mom and grandma looked really sad.

00:15:15.430 --> 00:15:19.300
Even so, the one thing I don't want 
to do is lie about how I feel.

00:15:20.390 --> 00:15:23.680
If I lie, I won't be able to hold anyone's hands.

00:15:24.060 --> 00:15:27.650
Hold hands... Are you serious?

00:15:27.650 --> 00:15:29.420
So I want you

00:15:29.420 --> 00:15:31.700
to do what you want to do, Shirabe-chan.

00:15:31.700 --> 00:15:34.660
If you want the same thing we do,

00:15:34.910 --> 00:15:37.110
I'd like you to help us a little.

00:15:39.850 --> 00:15:42.820
What I want to do?

00:15:43.420 --> 00:15:48.350
What you want to do is to stop your friends, 
who are out of control, right?

00:15:51.440 --> 00:15:54.180
If it's to save everyone, I'm willing to help you.

00:15:56.610 --> 00:15:58.130
But do you believe me?

00:15:58.440 --> 00:15:59.710
I was your enemy.

00:16:00.310 --> 00:16:02.800
It doesn't matter whether you're friend or enemy.

00:16:03.140 --> 00:16:06.190
No adult worth the name would stop a kid

00:16:06.190 --> 00:16:08.620
from doing something she wants to do.

00:16:08.620 --> 00:16:10.150
Master!

00:16:13.740 --> 00:16:15.740
This is a chance.

00:16:17.320 --> 00:16:19.120
You haven't changed at all.

00:16:19.350 --> 00:16:22.250
I know I spoil you. It's just who I am.

00:16:23.750 --> 00:16:25.780
I'll lead you to the hatch!

00:16:25.780 --> 00:16:26.700
Let's hurry!

00:16:34.410 --> 00:16:35.640
Hibiki!

00:16:35.900 --> 00:16:37.160
What are you doing?

00:16:37.160 --> 00:16:40.060
I told you I'm not letting you fight!

00:16:40.290 --> 00:16:41.820
I'm not fighting.

00:16:41.820 --> 00:16:42.980
I'm helping people.

00:16:43.320 --> 00:16:46.490
I never showed you any movies 
where the hero talked back!

00:16:46.890 --> 00:16:48.560
Please let her go.

00:16:49.340 --> 00:16:53.090
Saving people is the thing that's most like Hibiki.

00:16:55.590 --> 00:16:57.860
This sort of insane, crazy recklessness

00:16:57.860 --> 00:17:00.410
was supposed to be my job.

00:17:00.700 --> 00:17:02.200
You, too?

00:17:02.500 --> 00:17:04.080
She has a bad time waiting for her return?

00:17:04.420 --> 00:17:06.130
An especially big one.

00:17:06.350 --> 00:17:07.670
Then, as for us...

00:17:07.670 --> 00:17:09.500
Leave the backup to us.

00:17:09.780 --> 00:17:12.170
We'll support her in every way we can.

00:17:12.810 --> 00:17:16.180
I can't let the kids take all the glory.

00:17:17.680 --> 00:17:20.680
Tachibana and that wielder are together?

00:17:22.590 --> 00:17:24.790
<i>I certainly didn't see that coming.</i>

00:17:25.760 --> 00:17:27.940
Roger. I'll meet up with them immediately.

00:17:28.980 --> 00:17:30.940
<i>I chased the Noise too far, huh?</i>

00:17:35.180 --> 00:17:37.450
Looks like I've been lured out.

00:17:41.880 --> 00:17:44.620
I thought it was about time, Yukine.

00:17:46.890 --> 00:17:48.300
Everyone's over there?

00:17:48.640 --> 00:17:49.630
I don't know.

00:17:50.570 --> 00:17:52.630
But it feels that way.

00:17:53.010 --> 00:17:54.350
It feels that way?

00:17:57.580 --> 00:17:58.760
Wh-What's wrong?

00:18:02.520 --> 00:18:03.460
Kirika-chan!

00:18:05.240 --> 00:18:13.190
<i>Zeios Igalima raizen tron.</i>

00:18:35.740 --> 00:18:36.920
Death!

00:18:37.900 --> 00:18:39.130
Kiri-chan...

00:18:39.450 --> 00:18:41.680
Shirabe, you're doing this, no matter what?

00:18:42.640 --> 00:18:45.600
With the doctor's way of doing things, 
nothing will be left.

00:18:45.930 --> 00:18:49.110
Without his way, I can't leave anything behind!

00:18:49.110 --> 00:18:50.600
There's no time!

00:18:50.600 --> 00:18:53.230
Both of you, calm down and let's talk!

00:18:53.230 --> 00:18:55.610
This is a battleground! Don't be stupid!

00:18:56.180 --> 00:18:57.810
You go on ahead.

00:18:57.810 --> 00:19:00.610
I know you can stop Maria.

00:19:00.610 --> 00:19:02.370
She'll hold your hand.

00:19:02.370 --> 00:19:03.870
Shirabe-chan?

00:19:04.130 --> 00:19:07.390
The LiNKER that connects me to my Gear has a limit.

00:19:07.710 --> 00:19:08.780
So go.

00:19:10.050 --> 00:19:12.500
And believe in the song in your heart.

00:19:12.810 --> 00:19:15.380
Believe in the song in your heart.

00:19:19.340 --> 00:19:21.160
I won't let you!

00:19:22.590 --> 00:19:24.850
Shirabe! Why are you helping her?

00:19:25.260 --> 00:19:28.480
Isn't she one of those hypocrites you hate?

00:19:28.890 --> 00:19:32.680
But she isn't lying about who she is.

00:19:32.680 --> 00:19:35.030
She's really doing what she wants to do.

00:19:35.030 --> 00:19:36.730
She's so dazzling, I'm jealous.

00:19:37.000 --> 00:19:39.110
And I want to believe in her a little.

00:19:39.450 --> 00:19:40.620
I see...

00:19:41.040 --> 00:19:43.620
But I can't stop, either.

00:19:44.100 --> 00:19:46.000
I want to leave something physical behind,

00:19:46.000 --> 00:19:48.290
while I'm still me!

00:19:48.550 --> 00:19:50.790
While you're still you?

00:19:51.050 --> 00:19:54.380
I want to leave a world where 
you, Maria, and Mom can live,

00:19:54.380 --> 00:19:57.550
along with the proof that I was here!

00:19:57.950 --> 00:19:59.550
That's your reason?

00:19:59.550 --> 00:20:01.180
This is my reason!

00:20:07.350 --> 00:20:09.430
<b>K1LL JUL1ET</b>

00:20:10.560 --> 00:20:12.940
<b>Type Gamma Svastika Firewheel</b>

00:20:25.410 --> 00:20:31.640
<i>Death 13, a dream of despair, 
bringing down the Grim Reaper.</i>

00:20:31.160 --> 00:20:33.540
<b>Hidden Type Sigma Slashing Svastika</b>

00:20:31.640 --> 00:20:34.380
<i>An elegy sharper than a requiem.</i>

00:20:34.380 --> 00:20:37.800
<i>Welcome to terror!</i>

00:20:37.800 --> 00:20:44.050
<i>Realism mixed with errors, educating my DNA.</i>

00:20:41.630 --> 00:20:43.330
<i>If there's something...</i>

00:20:44.050 --> 00:20:45.920
<i>in your heart...</i>

00:20:45.920 --> 00:20:48.060
<i>that's making us fight!</i>

00:20:49.810 --> 00:20:52.430
<i>That's why I'm going to</i>

00:20:49.810 --> 00:20:52.430
<i>Before you even feel pain,</i>

00:20:52.430 --> 00:20:56.190
<i>slice this world to pieces.</i>

00:20:52.430 --> 00:20:56.190
<i>I'll carve you up!</i>

00:20:57.170 --> 00:21:01.190
<i>When we're connected and believe in one another,</i>

00:20:57.170 --> 00:21:01.190
<i>To protect someone,</i>

00:21:01.190 --> 00:21:06.180
<i>that's what I believe true strength is.</i>

00:21:01.190 --> 00:21:06.180
<i>I must believe true strength is courage.</i>

00:21:06.180 --> 00:21:09.200
<i>As I take your hand...</i>

00:21:09.200 --> 00:21:10.950
<i>I'm sure...</i>

00:21:09.200 --> 00:21:13.480
<i>I've almost forgotten that smile.</i>

00:21:10.950 --> 00:21:15.960
<i>I'm sure it's still okay, I can still fly.</i>

00:21:13.480 --> 00:21:15.960
<i>But it's okay, I can still fly.</i>

00:21:15.960 --> 00:21:18.880
<i>These bonds shone brightly.</i>

00:21:15.960 --> 00:21:20.490
<i>I'll hold these shining bonds close,</i>

00:21:18.880 --> 00:21:25.390
<i>Now let's sing a melody into the sky!</i>

00:21:20.490 --> 00:21:25.390
<i>singing a melody!</i>

00:21:23.250 --> 00:21:24.310
Why?

00:21:24.710 --> 00:21:27.430
Even Shirabe and Kirika, who were so close...

00:21:28.230 --> 00:21:30.020
I didn't make my choice

00:21:30.910 --> 00:21:34.350
because I wanted to see this!

00:21:34.720 --> 00:21:35.660
Maria.

00:21:36.730 --> 00:21:37.740
Mom!

00:21:37.740 --> 00:21:39.980
You're alone now, right?

00:21:40.820 --> 00:21:43.410
I've found a way that might enable me to

00:21:43.410 --> 00:21:47.290
analyze the information on Frontier, 
and stop the Moon from falling.

00:21:48.770 --> 00:21:51.240
It's our last hope...

00:21:51.470 --> 00:21:54.250
And I need your songs.

00:21:54.820 --> 00:21:56.930
My songs?

00:22:01.650 --> 00:22:03.510
<i>As long as there's</i>

00:22:03.510 --> 00:22:05.930
<i>a song in my heart!</i>
